<section class="faq-section" style="padding: 50px 0; background: #0b132b; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08);">
  <div class="container" style="max-width: 1000px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 0 15px;">
    <h2 style="color: #ffffff; font-size: 1.7rem; font-weight: 800; margin-bottom: 25px; text-align: center;">
      Frequently Asked Questions &bull; Car Transportation in Srinivaspur 8409531615
    </h2>
    
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">What makes car transportation in Srinivaspur with Shree Ashirwad different from regular packers and movers?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Shree Ashirwad combines a dedicated car carrier fleet with hydraulic ramp trailers, GPS‑enabled live tracking, and a zero‑scratch guarantee. Unlike generic movers who may use open trucks, our 120+ specialized containers provide enclosed, climate‑controlled transport, backed by ISO‑certified quality management and IRDAI‑approved insurance, ensuring both safety and peace of mind.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">How does the hydraulic ramp trailer ensure my vehicle remains scratch‑free during transit?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">The hydraulic ramp trailer features a low‑profile, non‑abrasive loading ramp with anti‑slip rubberized surfaces. Once the vehicle is positioned, high‑tensile ratchet lashings secure it to reinforced wheel chocks, preventing movement. The enclosed trailer shields the car from external impacts, while the ramp’s smooth operation eliminates contact with body panels, delivering a scratch‑free guarantee.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">Can I ship my car by train from Srinivaspur, and how does it compare to road carrier service?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Railway vehicle transport is available for long‑distance moves, offering cost‑effectiveness on high‑volume routes. However, it requires additional handling at rail yards, which can increase the risk of minor dents. Road carrier service with Shree Ashirwad provides door‑to‑door convenience, real‑time GPS tracking, and the zero‑scratch guarantee, making it the preferred choice for premium protection.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">What documents are mandatory for booking a car carrier service from Srinivaspur to another city?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Essential paperwork includes a valid government‑issued vehicle registration, a GST‑compliant invoice, an e‑Way bill for interstate movement, a signed transport agreement, and a copy of the driver’s licence. If you opt for railway transport, a railway vehicle transport permit and loading order are also required. All documents must be presented before loading.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">Is insurance included in the quoted price, and what does the zero‑scratch guarantee cover?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Yes, every car transportation quote includes a 100% IRDAI‑approved marine transit insurance that covers declared value against accidental damage, theft, or natural calamities. The zero‑scratch guarantee complements the insurance by pledging that no surface scratches will occur during loading, transit, or unloading, provided the vehicle is prepared according to our pre‑move checklist.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">How is the cost for car transportation calculated for a distance of about 850 km from Srinivaspur?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Pricing is based on a base fare for the first 100 km, a per‑kilometer surcharge for the remaining distance, vehicle size classification, optional insurance coverage, and any special handling (e.g., luxury or vintage cars). A transparent quote breaks down each component, allowing you to see exactly how the 850 km route influences the final amount.</p>
      </div>
  </div>
